        "Content": "Rooney Auctioneers present a unique and exciting mixed-use Residential and Retail Investment unit for sale with vacant possession.\r\nResidential:\r\nThis 4 bedroom property is well maintained and offers an abundance of natural light and a practical internal layout. The entrance hallway leads through to a separate spacious kitchen/living. Upstairs there are four bedrooms, main bathroom. The property is offered with vacant possession. \r\n\r\nRetail:\r\nHair Salon Ground Floor.\r\nTiled floor, Bathroom, Storage room \r\nOwn entrance door.\r\n\r\nGarage/ Store Room:\r\nRear ground floor large storage/ garage, having its own entrance door, possible to convert into living accommodation subject to planning permission.\r\n\r\nAll units having their own electricity meters.\r\n\r\nContact Peter Kearney 061413511\r\npeterkearney@rooneys.eu"
